      "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"dsh-reasoning-tiers\",\n  \"version\": \"0.3.1\",\n  \"description\": \"DeepSeek Harness 插件：为第三方模型提供商的模型自动匹配模型名称并补齐推理档位（reasoning effort），使思考强度选择器在官方模型选择器中可用；并在设置页提供「模型能力」页，可编辑每个已添加模型的上下文窗口/输出上限/图片多模态。适配 DSH 0.2.0（settings/document-updated、configForms）。Third-party DSH plugin that matches model ids against a built-in knowledge table, declares per-model reasoning tiers in the llm-pi-ai settings section, and adds a settings page for per-model context window, output cap and image modality. Built against DSH 0.2.0; also runs on 0.1.5 hosts.\",\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"dsh\",\n    \"dsh-plugin\",\n    \"deepseek-harness\",\n    \"reasoning-effort\",\n    \"thinking\",\n    \"reasoning\",\n    \"llm-pi-ai\",\n    \"llm-settings\"\n  ],\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"lib/index.d.ts\",\n  \"repository\": {\n    \"type\": \"git\",\n    \"url\": \"git+ssh://git@github.com/1069137617/dsh-reasoning-tiers.git\"\n  },\n  \"homepage\": \"https://github.com/1069137617/dsh-reasoning-tiers#readme\",\n  \"bugs\": \"https://github.com/1069137617/dsh-reasoning-tiers/issues\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"types\": \"./lib/index.d.ts\",\n      \"default\": \"./lib/index.js\"\n    },\n    \"./client\": {\n      \"default\": \"./lib/client.js\"\n    },\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"lib\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"README.zh.md\",\n    \"LICENSE\"\n  ],\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    },\n    \"client\": {\n      \"platform\": \"web\",\n      \"inject\": []\n    }\n  },\n  \"engines\": {\n    \"node\": \">=20\"\n  },\n  \"os\": [\n    \"darwin\",\n    \"linux\",\n    \"win32\"\n  ],\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"build\": \"npm run build:host && npm run build:client\",\n    \"build:host\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.json\",\n    \"build:client\": \"node scripts/build.mjs\",\n    \"watch\": \"node scripts/build.mjs --watch\",\n    \"clean\": \"node -e \\\"require('node:fs').rmSync('lib',{recursive:true,force:true})\\\"\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit && tsc -p tsconfig.client.json --noEmit\",\n    \"pretest\": \"npm run build\",\n    \"test\": \"node --test\",\n    \"verify:install\": \"node scripts/verify-install.mjs\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm test\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"^4.0.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths\": \">=0.1.5-rc.1 || >=0.2.0-rc.1\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm\": \">=0.1.5-rc.1 || >=0.2.0-rc.1\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings\": \">=0.1.5-rc.1 || >=0.2.0-rc.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@deepseek-ai/cordis\": \"4.0.4\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-home-paths\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings\": \"0.2.0-rc.2\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"^24.0.0\",\n    \"@types/react\": \"~18.3.1\",\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"~18.3.0\",\n    \"esbuild\": \"^0.28.2\",\n    \"js-yaml\": \"^5.4.1\",\n    \"react\": \"^18.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^18.3.1\",\n    \"typescript\": \"5.9.3\"\n  },\n  \"publishConfig\": {\n    \"access\": \"public\",\n    \"registry\": \"https://registry.npmjs.org/\"\n  }\n}\n"
